{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_384630","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"昨夜凌晨，\nGear REX从太平洋沿岸登陆哥斯达黎加南部后，\n仍在继续北上……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"今天中午，它抵达伊拉苏西部的火山口附近。\n现在已经停下行动。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"没有军队的哥斯达黎加无法阻止它的肆虐，\n附近接连传来住宅、建筑物等遭Gear REX破坏的报告。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"拜托了！为了哥斯达黎加的和平，赶往当地，\n让Gear REX平静下来！\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""}]}